---
import AcademicsNavbar from '../../components/AcademicsNavbar.astro';
import AcademicsFooter from '../../components/AcademicsFooter.astro';
import '../../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang='en'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <title>Student Guide | SPMH Academics</title>
    <link
      href='https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto:wght@400;500;700;900&family=Open+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap'
      rel='stylesheet'
    />
    <style>
      * {
        font-family: 'Open Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
      }
      h1,
      h2,
      h3,
      h4,
      h5,
      h6 {
        font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body class='bg-white text-slate-900'>
    <AcademicsNavbar />

    <main class='min-h-screen'>
      <!-- Hero -->
      <section
        class='bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-600 to-cyan-800 text-white py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8'>
        <div class='max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center'>
          <h1 class='text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold mb-4'>Student Guide</h1>
          <p class='text-xl text-cyan-100'>
            Everything you need to know about clinical training at SPMH
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Content -->
      <section class='py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8'>
        <div class='max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-12'>
          <!-- Eligibility -->
          <div>
            <h2 class='text-3xl font-bold mb-6'>Eligibility Requirements</h2>
            <div class='bg-cyan-50 p-8 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-cyan-600'>
              <ul class='space-y-3 text-lg text-slate-700'>
                <li class='flex items-start gap-3'>
                  <span class='text-cyan-600 font-bold text-xl'>✓</span>
                  <span
                    >Currently enrolled student in a recognized healthcare
                    program</span
                  >
                </li>
                <li class='flex items-start gap-3'>
                  <span class='text-cyan-600 font-bold text-xl'>✓</span>
                  <span
                    >Valid medical fitness certificate from a healthcare
                    provider</span
                  >
                </li>
                <li class='flex items-start gap-3'>
                  <span class='text-cyan-600 font-bold text-xl'>✓</span>
                  <span>Letter of support from your academic institution</span>
                </li>
                <li class='flex items-start gap-3'>
                  <span class='text-cyan-600 font-bold text-xl'>✓</span>
                  <span
                    >Committed to professional conduct and patient safety</span
                  >
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Application Process -->
          <div>
            <h2 class='text-3xl font-bold mb-6'>Application Process</h2>
            <div class='space-y-4'>
              <div class='flex gap-4'>
                <div class='flex-shrink-0'>
                  <div
                    class='w-12 h-12 bg-cyan-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg'>
                    1
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h3 class='font-bold text-lg mb-2'>
                    Submit Online Application
                  </h3>
                  <p class='text-slate-600'>
                    Fill out our application form with your personal, academic,
                    and contact information. Takes approximately 15 minutes.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class='flex gap-4'>
                <div class='flex-shrink-0'>
                  <div
                    class='w-12 h-12 bg-cyan-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg'>
                    2
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h3 class='font-bold text-lg mb-2'>
                    HR Verification (3-5 days)
                  </h3>
                  <p class='text-slate-600'>
                    Our HR team will review your application and verify your
                    academic status with your institution.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class='flex gap-4'>
                <div class='flex-shrink-0'>
                  <div
                    class='w-12 h-12 bg-cyan-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg'>
                    3
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h3 class='font-bold text-lg mb-2'>
                    Preceptor Assignment (1-2 weeks)
                  </h3>
                  <p class='text-slate-600'>
                    You'll be matched with a certified clinical mentor in your
                    preferred department.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class='flex gap-4'>
                <div class='flex-shrink-0'>
                  <div
                    class='w-12 h-12 bg-cyan-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg'>
                    4
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h3 class='font-bold text-lg mb-2'>
                    Clinical Rotation (6-12 weeks)
                  </h3>
                  <p class='text-slate-600'>
                    Begin your hands-on training with real patients and clinical
                    teams at SPMH.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class='flex gap-4'>
                <div class='flex-shrink-0'>
                  <div
                    class='w-12 h-12 bg-green-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg'>
                    ✓
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h3 class='font-bold text-lg mb-2'>
                    Completion & Certification
                  </h3>
                  <p class='text-slate-600'>
                    Receive your certificate of completion and detailed
                    evaluation from your preceptor.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- What to Expect -->
          <div>
            <h2 class='text-3xl font-bold mb-6'>
              What to Expect During Your Attachment
            </h2>
            <div class='grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6'>
              <div class='p-6 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg'>
                <h3 class='font-bold text-lg mb-3'>Daily Responsibilities</h3>
                <ul class='space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-700'>
                  <li>• Arrive 30 minutes before shift start</li>
                  <li>• Follow all hospital protocols and safety procedures</li>
                  <li>• Work closely with your assigned preceptor</li>
                  <li>• Participate in patient care and procedures</li>
                  <li>• Maintain detailed clinical notes</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div class='p-6 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg'>
                <h3 class='font-bold text-lg mb-3'>Support & Resources</h3>
                <ul class='space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-700'>
                  <li>• Dedicated preceptor for mentoring</li>
                  <li>• Access to SPMH library and learning materials</li>
                  <li>• Weekly supervision and feedback sessions</li>
                  <li>• Peer support from other students</li>
                  <li>• Professional development workshops</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Frequently Asked Questions -->
          <div>
            <h2 class='text-3xl font-bold mb-6'>Quick FAQs</h2>
            <div class='space-y-4'>
              <details class='p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg cursor-pointer group'>
                <summary
                  class='font-bold text-lg text-slate-900 group-open:text-cyan-600'
                  >Can I choose my department rotation?</summary
                >
                <p class='mt-3 text-slate-700'>
                  Yes! During your application, you can indicate your preferred
                  departments. We'll do our best to accommodate your preferences
                  based on availability.
                </p>
              </details>
              <details class='p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg cursor-pointer group'>
                <summary
                  class='font-bold text-lg text-slate-900 group-open:text-cyan-600'
                  >Is there accommodation at SPMH?</summary
                >
                <p class='mt-3 text-slate-700'>
                  SPMH doesn't provide student housing, but we can help you find
                  affordable accommodation in Homa Bay through our network.
                </p>
              </details>
              <details class='p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg cursor-pointer group'>
                <summary
                  class='font-bold text-lg text-slate-900 group-open:text-cyan-600'
                  >What if I have medical concerns during my attachment?</summary
                >
                <p class='mt-3 text-slate-700'>
                  SPMH provides basic medical support. For serious concerns, our
                  occupational health team will assist you and coordinate care
                  if needed.
                </p>
              </details>
              <details class='p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg cursor-pointer group'>
                <summary
                  class='font-bold text-lg text-slate-900 group-open:text-cyan-600'
                  >Will I receive a salary during my attachment?</summary
                >
                <p class='mt-3 text-slate-700'>
                  Clinical attachments are typically unpaid educational
                  experiences. However, some sponsoring institutions may provide
                  stipends—check with your school.
                </p>
              </details>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- CTA -->
          <div
            class='bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-600 to-cyan-800 text-white p-10 rounded-lg text-center'>
            <h3 class='text-2xl font-bold mb-3'>Ready to Apply?</h3>
            <p class='mb-6 text-cyan-100'>
              Start your clinical training journey at SPMH today.
            </p>
            <a
              href='/#internships'
              class='bg-white text-cyan-600 hover:bg-cyan-50 font-bold px-8 py-3 rounded-lg transition-colors inline-block'>
              Apply Now
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <AcademicsFooter />
  </body>
</html>
